"offset": Vector2(-1920, 2000),
"start_id": "2"
},
&"1_1": {
"dialogue": "...",
"offset": Vector2(-3160, 160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_10": {
"dialogue": "Finally, using a ranged attack will only transmute your opponent. Melee attacks will affect both you and your opponent.",
"offset": Vector2(-708.979, 1611.65),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_12": {
"dialogue": "The preset limits the amount of transmutations possible in a battle, by controlling the typing and movesets of all combatants.",
"offset": Vector2(-980, -320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_13",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_13": {
"dialogue": "This will also modify the transmutation menu, hiding the irrelevant parts. ",
"offset": Vector2(-640, -320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_2": {
"dialogue": "",
"offset": Vector2(-3160, -160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_21": {
"dialogue": "When combatants transmute, there are side effects that alter our stats.",
"offset": Vector2(-1700, 1660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_23",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_23": {
"dialogue": "When you go from:
[ul][color=blue]Defensive[/color] -> [color=blue]Defensive[/color] = Speed boost.[/ul]
[ul][color=red]Offensive[/color] -> [color=red]Offensive[/color] = Speed boost.[/ul]
[ul][color=red]Offensive[/color] -> [color=blue]Defensive[/color] = Defense boost.[/ul]
[ul] [color=blue]Defensive[/color] -> [color=red]Offensive[/color] = Attack boost.[/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1360, 1660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_26",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_24": {
"dialogue": "Defensive Types:
[ul][el]Blue[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Cyan[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Magenta[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Yellow[/el][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-2320, 1700),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_25": {
"dialogue": "Offensive Types:
[ul][el]Green[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Purple[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Orange[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Red[/el][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-2320, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_26": {
"dialogue": "The 3rd tab in your transmutation menu shows this information in detail.",
"offset": Vector2(-1020, 1660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_27": {
"dialogue": "Two more things.",
"offset": Vector2(-1720, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_28",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_28": {
"dialogue": "Firstly, sometimes your secondary type will become gray, or blank. ",
"offset": Vector2(-1380, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_29",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_29": {
"dialogue": "Blank does not react with any other elements. However, channelling elemental energy via an attack will cause your Blank typing to match that of the attack.",
"offset": Vector2(-1040, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_10",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_3": {
"dialogue": "Hi, welcome to test candidate 1! This is a simplified version of the game intended to test the combat mechanics.",
"offset": Vector2(-2240, -400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_33",
"text": "How does this work?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_6",
"text": "Preset?"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "Goodbye"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 343),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_30": {
"dialogue": "Since you were able to bypass Aqua's little experiments on the beach, I assume you have a basic understanding of the transmutation system.[br][br]But should you need a reminder, you can press 'T' to view the menu.",
"offset": Vector2(-1700, 1340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_31",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 265),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_31": {
"dialogue": "Unlike Aqua's little blocks, however, combatants can have 2 types.",
"offset": Vector2(-1320, 1400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_32",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_32": {
"dialogue": "Select an attack from the menu below. I suggest selecting [el]Purple Hit[/el].",
"offset": Vector2(-960, 1340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_40",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_33": {
"dialogue": "Sure, what's up?",
"offset": Vector2(-1740, -1200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_36",
"text": "The Elements?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"5_1",
"text": "Combat?"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_37",
"text": "Bosses?"
},
3: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "Goodbye"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 343),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_34": {
"dialogue": "The [i]Transmutation System[/i] is the central mechanic of this game.",
"offset": Vector2(-880, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_35",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_35": {
"dialogue": "In battle, all combatants have 2 elements.",
"offset": Vector2(-540, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_44",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_36": {
"dialogue": "This world is composed of 8 elements, each styled after a color.",
"offset": Vector2(-1360, -1580),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_38",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_37": {
"dialogue": "Thre three blob monsters in front of us are the bosses. Fighting them is the purpose of this demo.",
"offset": Vector2(-1260, -620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_59",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_38": {
"dialogue": "[ul][el]Blue[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Purple[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Magenta[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Red[/el][/ul]
cont...",
"offset": Vector2(-1020, -1580),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_39",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_39": {
"dialogue": "[ul][el]Orange[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Yellow[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Green[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Cyan[/el][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-680, -1580),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_41",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_40": {
"dialogue": "If you hover your mouse over the opponent, you'll be shown the Transmutation Hint.",
"offset": Vector2(-660, 1340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_8",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"1_41": {
"dialogue": "Sometimes, when two elements come into contact, they [i]transmute[/i] into a new form. ",
"offset": Vector2(-360, -1580),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_42",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_42": {
"dialogue": "Pressing 'T' will open your [i]Transmutation Menu[/i]. It shows these relationships.",
"offset": Vector2(-20, -1580),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"4_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_43": {
"dialogue": "The [i]Transmutation System[/i] is the central mechanic of this game. (To learn more about this, ask me about \"The Elements\").",
"offset": Vector2(-880, -960),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_35",
"text": "Please continue"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_36",
"text": "The Elements?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 308),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_44": {
"dialogue": "As you come into contact with the elements in this world, they begin to permeate through your body. Your [i]Primary type[/i] shows what element your core is, i.e. your insides.",
"offset": Vector2(-203.221, -1259.42),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_45",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_45": {
"dialogue": "Your [i]Primary type[/i] has a lot of inertia and does not change easily.",
"offset": Vector2(140, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_51",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_46": {
"dialogue": "All you need to remember is that the type of your first slot will not change in battle.",
"offset": Vector2(820, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_47",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_47": {
"dialogue": "Your [i]Secondary type[/i] shows the element of your surface, your skin essentially.",
"offset": Vector2(1160, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_48",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_48": {
"dialogue": "This thin crust is very reactive, reacting to any element it comes into contact with.",
"offset": Vector2(1500, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_49",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_49": {
"dialogue": "This largely applies to your opponent's spells. However, your [i]Secondary type[/i] will also react to your own [i]melee[/i] attacks, since you're channeling that energy in close quarters.",
"offset": Vector2(1840, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_50",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_5": {
"dialogue": "During the actual game, this will be done slowly and subtly. However, since this demo has been simplified down, I've decided to make this a little more blatant. ",
"offset": Vector2(-300, -320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_50": {
"dialogue": "Additionally, your [i]Secondary type[/i] will react with your [i]Primary type[/i]. Only the [i]Secondary[/i] will change, of course.",
"offset": Vector2(2180, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_52",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_51": {
"dialogue": " For those of us that have spent a year or more in this place, this is permanent. If you see the terms [i]alignment[/i] or [i]bias[/i], those are referring to this phenomena.",
"offset": Vector2(480, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_46",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_52": {
"dialogue": "So for every attack, there can be up to 2 transmutations. First, your [i]Secondary type[/i] can react with the attack's type. Then, your [i]Secondary type[/i] can react with with your [i]Primary[/i].",
"offset": Vector2(2520, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_53",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_53": {
"dialogue": "One last thing, I promise. Every transmutation comes with side effects: stat buffs that depend on your initial and resulting typing.",
"offset": Vector2(2860, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_54",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_54": {
"dialogue": "The elements are divided into two \"[i]Affinity[/i]\" groups: [color=blue]Defensive[/color] and [color=red]Offensive[/color].",
"offset": Vector2(3200, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_56",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_55": {
"dialogue": "This information, as well as which elements are in which groups, can be found in the [i]Affinity[/i] tab in your [i]Transmutation menu[/i].",
"offset": Vector2(4560, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_33",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_56": {
"dialogue": "Transmuting from a [color=blue]Defensive[/color] to an [color=red]Offensive[/color] one will give you an [color=red]attack[/color]buff.",
"offset": Vector2(3538.35, -1259.01),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_57",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_57": {
"dialogue": "Likewise, going from an [color=red]Offensive[/color] to a [color=blue]Defensive[/color] one will give you an [color=blue]defense[/color] buff.",
"offset": Vector2(3880, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_58",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_58": {
"dialogue": "Finally, staying in the same [i]Affinity[/i] group will give you a [color=green]speed[/color] buff.",
"offset": Vector2(4220, -1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_55",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_59": {
"dialogue": "If you wouldn't mind giving me a hand in fighting them, I'd really appreciate it.",
"offset": Vector2(-920.565, -617.038),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_60",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_6": {
"dialogue": "Admittedly, the [i]Transmutation system[/i] can take a little bit of getting used to.",
"offset": Vector2(-1320, -320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_12",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_60": {
"dialogue": "I'll let you decide when we start each battle, as well as the order we fight them in. However, I will note they should escalate in difficulty from left to right, so I'd suggest fighting the leftmost one first.",
"offset": Vector2(-580, -620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_33",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
&"1_8": {
"dialogue": "The first two rows show how the target's primary and secondary typings will react with the attack.[br][br]The third row shows whether the resulting primary and secondary typings will react with each other.",
"offset": Vector2(-320, 1340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": -1
},
&"2_1": {
"comment": "Objectives:
- Attack + Primary/Secondary
- Primary + Secondary
- Side effects
- Melee vs ranged
- Intentions",
"offset": Vector2(-2320, 1320),
"size": Vector2(360, 180)
},
&"2_3": {
"comment": "[ul]When a [color=blue]defensive element[/color] transmute into another [color=blue]defensive element[/color], they get a speed boost.[/ul]
[ul]The same goes for when a [color=red]offensive element[/color] transmutes into another [color=red]offensive element[/color].[/ul]
[ul]When a [color=red]offensive element[/color] transmutes into a  [color=blue]defensive element[/color], they get a defensive bonus.[/ul]
[ul] When a [color=blue]defensive element[/color] transmutes into a  [color=red]offensive element[/color], they get an offensive bonus.[/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-2320, 1560),
"size": Vector2(200, 100)
},
&"3_1": {
"link": "END",
"offset": Vector2(-2800, 160),
"signalValue": "battle_started"
},
